# Committed direnv entrypoint — scaffolded once by evie-kit setup;
# from now on this file is yours (setup never rewrites it).
#
# POLICY: secrets are never ambient. They stay file-resolved — the
# settings layers declare them via envFiles (.envrc.local /
# .env.secrets), and every evie-kit verb self-resolves them in its
# own process. Deliberately NO `dotenv .envrc.local` here: an
# ambient export would inherit into editors, LSPs, and every npx
# child. For an ad-hoc shell need, `source .envrc.local` yourself,
# deliberately, in that one shell.
#
# Non-secret ergonomics only below.
PATH_add node_modules/.bin
